"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"152824922":{"pageid":152824922,"ns":6,"title":"File:Just 10 munits Chicken Ricotta Meatballs with Risoni in Tomato Basil Sauce.jpg","index":2,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Just_10_munits_Chicken_Ricotta_Meatballs_with_Risoni_in_Tomato_Basil_Sauce.jpg/960px-Just_10_munits_Chicken_Ricotta_Meatballs_with_Risoni_in_Tomato_Basil_Sauce.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":960,"thumbheight":1440,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/Just_10_munits_Chicken_Ricotta_Meatballs_with_Risoni_in_Tomato_Basil_Sauce.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Just_10_munits_Chicken_Ricotta_Meatballs_with_Risoni_in_Tomato_Basil_Sauce.jpg/960px-Just_10_munits_Chicken_Ricotta_Meatballs_with_Risoni_in_Tomato_Basil_Sauce.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":960,"height":1440,"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/Just_10_munits_Chicken_Ricotta_Meatballs_with_Risoni_in_Tomato_Basil_Sauce.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/Just_10_munits_Chicken_Ricotta_Meatballs_with_Risoni_in_Tomato_Basil_Sauce.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Just_10_munits_Chicken_Ricotta_Meatballs_with_Risoni_in_Tomato_Basil_Sauce.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=152824922","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2024-09-18 17:30:35","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Just 10 munits Chicken Ricotta Meatballs with Risoni in Tomato Basil Sauce","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Orzo|Chicken dishes of Japan|Vegetable-based food of Japan|Beef dishes of Japan|Stir fried dishes of Japan|Self-published work|Colorful food|Pasta dishes of Japan|Ricotta-based food|Stir fried beef with vegetables|Mushroom dishes in Japan","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Looking for a hearty and delicious meal? These Chicken Ricotta Meatballs with Risoni are perfect for a cozy dinner. Packed with rich flavors from parmesan, lemon, and basil, this dish is both satisfying and easy to make. Follow the steps below to create a meal that will impress your family or guests.\n<p>Ingredients:\n</p><p>500g Coles RSPCA Approved Chicken Mince\n250g fresh ricotta, crumbled\n25g (1/3 cup) finely grated parmesan\nFinely grated rind of 1 lemon\n1 green shallot, finely chopped\n1 garlic clove, crushed\n2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil\n500g jar Coles Mum\u2019s Sauce Tomato &amp; Basil\n250ml (1 cup) Massel salt-reduced chicken-style liquid stock\n1/2 bunch fresh basil, top leaves torn off\n105g (1/2 cup) dried risoni pasta\nExtra parmesan, for serving\nInstructions:\n</p><p>Step 1: Prepare the Meatballs\nIn a large bowl, combine the chicken mince, ricotta, parmesan, lemon rind, shallot, and garlic. Season the mixture well with salt and pepper. Roll the mixture into about 12 golf ball-sized meatballs and place them on a plate, ready for cooking.\n</p><p>Step 2: Cook the Meatballs and Simmer the Sauce\nHeat extra virgin olive oil in a large non-stick frying pan over high heat. Add the meatballs and cook for 3 minutes, turning them occasionally until they are just browned on all sides. Pour in the Coles Mum\u2019s Sauce Tomato &amp; Basil, chicken stock, and risoni pasta. Stir well to combine the ingredients. Reduce the heat to medium, cover the pan, and let the mixture simmer for 9 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the risoni is tender and the chicken meatballs are cooked through.\n</p><p>Step 3: Serve\nTop with the torn basil leaves and extra parmesan. Serve immediately for a warm and comforting meal.\n</p><p>Enjoy your Chicken Ricotta Meatballs with Risoni!\n</p>\nThis recipe is packed with flavorful ingredients like ricotta, parmesan, and basil, making it a great option for weeknight dinners or special occasions. The chicken mince meatballs, paired with the rich tomato basil sauce and tender risoni, create a delicious, well-balanced dish that everyone will love.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2024-09-18","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=User:Visits_to_visit&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Visits to visit (page does not exist)\">Visits to visit</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-sa-4.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"96258086":{